.TH "libnvme" 9 "struct nvme_host_addressable_ns_data" "October 2026" "API Manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
struct nvme_host_addressable_ns_data \- Addressable Namespaces Data Structure
.SH SYNOPSIS
struct nvme_host_addressable_ns_data {
.br
.BI "    __le32 nsid;"
.br
.BI "    __u8 mat;"
.br
.BI "    __u8 rsvd5[3];"
.br
.BI "    __le64 memo;"
.br
.BI "
};
.br

.SH Members
.IP "nsid" 12
Namespace Identifier, may or may not be attached to the
controller processing the command
.IP "mat" 12
Memory Access Type, see \fIenum nvme_host_addressable_ns_mat\fP
.IP "rsvd5" 12
Reserved
.IP "memo" 12
Memory Offset, the offset of the memory address for this
namespace from the base address of the memory access type
indicated in \fImat\fP
